{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>LIGHT-HEARTED Metroidvania</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2342000/extras/935413f5057901dffedc2bf509baa924.avif?t=1753984676\" data-has-big width=800 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a bustling resort packed with a water park, hotels and much more! Reso-Seeker is a Metroidvania game that allows you to unlock new areas by finding new items and bonding with friends you meet along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Switch Characters and Skills to Solve Puzzles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2342000/extras/c4f3a943b7ca386751ddccf1143d7975.avif?t=1753984676\" data-has-big width=800 height=300 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Lots of Events Unique to the Resort</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2342000/extras/fc7c6bf53860e14cbfcc2512700c83d9.avif?t=1753984676\" data-has-big width=800 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can enjoy communication with lots of guests\u00a0by taking photos, etc.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story full of Surprises and Comedy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2342000/extras/da1a9ec76b697ffb446f7d9cc5d941e8.avif?t=1753984676\" data-has-big width=800 height=300 /></span><br>Rena wakes up in the resort and starts exploration. Soon she finds she has not booked the resort because a cat-like creature has stolen her invitation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rena tries t